[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2757360983","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104681#issuecomment-2757360983","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104681","id":2757360983,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kWf1X","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-27T09:44:31Z","updated_at":"2025-03-27T09:44:31Z","body":"This is largely a duplicate of #104343.\n\nBasically, the `backface_collision` property of `ConcavePolygonShape3D` was mistakenly always enabled when using Jolt Physics prior to Godot 4.4.1, which it shouldn't be. You'll find that it now behaves exactly the same as with Godot Physics, as it should.\n\nThe fix in your case is as simple as enabling this property manually on your shape resources instead:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fffcd267-6f2e-43c8-aeb4-11a9c05a81ae)\n\nHowever, keep in mind that enabling back-face collisions also impacts the collision detection with dynamic bodies (i.e. `RigidBody3D`) which can lead to weird artifacts. For something like a box I would recommend that you use `BoxShape3D` instead.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2757360983/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2757559901","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104681#issuecomment-2757559901","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104681","id":2757559901,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kXQZd","user":{"login":"mlaraba","id":97417520,"node_id":"U_kgDOBc55MA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97417520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlaraba","html_url":"https://github.com/mlaraba","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlaraba/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlaraba/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlaraba/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlaraba/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlaraba/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlaraba/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlaraba/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlaraba/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlaraba/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-27T10:40:29Z","updated_at":"2025-03-27T10:40:29Z","body":"Thanks a lot!! and my apologies for the duplicate\nwent through the change-logs several times  and saw the ConcavePolygonShape3D backface_collision update but stupidly didn't think it was related.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2757559901/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":